This project reads ONYX BOOX .note exports and renders them on a Mac.

The zip layout, point records, and pen widths are reimplemented from public descriptions of device exports.
boox-note-parser by Harry Hornbacher is Apache-2.0.
boox-note-optimizer by nrontsis documents the same modern zip.
This repository does not copy their source.

Bundled Noto Sans Thai Regular and Bold are from the Noto project:
